From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vlad Panazan <git@praznet.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 05:08:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] androidfw: replace CombinedIterator merge in
 Theme::ApplyStyle; hwui: accept both 8888 color orders in ImageDecoder;
 minikin-adjacent JNI fixes for host

- AssetManager2 Theme::ApplyStyle: index-based merge instead of
  std::inplace_merge/remove_if over CombinedIterator (libstdc++ iterator
  requirements)
- ImageDecoder::setOutColorType (hwui): accept the other 8888 order, since
  nixpkgs libskia's internal kN32 may differ from ours
---
